{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cb73","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae2b-f4bb-7310-a5c5-e45123d43dca"},"sequence":1044,"recorded_at":1780531400002083,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f3ccc2af-522d-4b28-99ba-3a506c9bdcb3","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f3ccc2af-522d-4b28-99ba-3a506c9bdcb3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f3ccc2af-522d-4b28-99ba-3a506c9bdcb3"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0ae31-6cb7-7e53-b2ee-52677b921f88"},"task_id":"01a0ae31-6cb7-7e53-b2ee-52677b921f88","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0ae31-6cb7-7e53-b2ee-52677b921f88","chunk":"Read text file `internal/traceability/traceability_test.go`.\n1|package traceability\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"bytes\"\n5|\t\"crypto/sha256\"\n6|\t\"encoding/json\"\n7|\t\"errors\"\n8|\t\"io/fs\"\n9|\t\"os\"\n10|\t\"path/filepath\"\n11|\t\"reflect\"\n12|\t\"sort\"\n13|\t\"strings\"\n14|\t\"testing\"\n15|\t\"testing/fstest\"\n16|\n17|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/catalog\"\n18|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/specdoc\"\n19|\t\"github.com/relux-works/agent-session-manager/internal/specpin\"\n20|)\n21|\n22|func TestVerifyRepositoryAcceptsExactOwnership(t *testing.T) {\n23|\tt.Parallel()\n24|\n25|\treport, err := VerifyRepository(repositorySnapshot(t))\n26|\tif err != nil {\n27|\t\tt.Fatalf(\"VerifyRepository() error = %v\", err)\n28|\t}\n29|\twant := Report{\n30|\t\tContracts:              63,\n31|\t\tNormativeSections:      36,\n32|\t\tAcceptanceCases:        105,\n33|\t\tFixtures:               32,\n34|\t\tCompatibilityContracts: 55,\n35|\t\tSectionBindings:        59,\n36|\t\tFullCoverage:           1,\n37|\t\tPartialCoverage:        3,\n38|\t\tSliverCoverage:         1,\n39|\t\tUnevidencedCoverage:    50,\n40|\t\tUnmeasuredCoverage:     4,\n41|\t\tUnownedSections:        12,\n42|\t\tNormativeClauses:       489,\n43|\